// 勾選框（打勾筆畫由左往右畫出、勾選時彈一下）與待辦項目（加刪除線由左往右劃過）。
import { Theme, Motion } from "../theme.slint";
import { Icon, Icons } from "icons.slint";

export component Checkbox {
    in-out property <bool> checked;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    in property <string> label;
    callback toggled(checked: bool);
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    opacity: enabled ? 1 : 0.45;
    accessible-role: checkbox;
    accessible-checkable: true;
    accessible-checked: checked;
    accessible-label: label;
    accessible-action-default => { ta.clicked(); }
    property <float> pop: 1;
    property <bool> snap;
    changed checked => {
        if checked {
            snap = true;
            pop = 0.6;
            snap = false;
            pop = 1;
        }
    }
    animate pop {
        duration: snap ? 0ms : Motion.spring-dur;
        easing: Motion.spring;
    }
    // 打勾筆畫的繪製進度（以由左往右的裁切模擬 stroke-dashoffset）
    property <float> draw: checked ? 1 : 0;
    animate draw {
        duration: root.checked ? 350ms : 150ms;
        delay: root.checked ? 50ms : 0ms;
        easing: Motion.out;
    }
    Rectangle {
        transform-scale: root.pop;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: root.checked ? Theme.ink : transparent;
        border-width: root.checked ? 0px : 1.5px;
        border-color: Theme.faint;
        animate background { duration: 250ms; }
        Rectangle {
            x: 3.5px;
            y: 3.5px;
            width: 13px * root.draw;
            height: 13px;
            clip: true;
            Icon {
                x: 0;
                y: 0;
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
                path: Icons.check;
                color: Theme.on-ink;
                weight: 3;
            }
        }
    }
    ta := TouchArea {
        enabled: root.enabled;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => {
            root.checked = !root.checked;
            root.toggled(root.checked);
        }
    }
}
